# 📘 TOEFL Academic Vocabulary - Day26

| Word | Meaning | Example |
|---|---|---|
| diminish | 감소하다, 약화시키다 | The effects of the medicine gradually diminished. |
| substantial | 상당한 | The study found a substantial increase. |
| predict | 예측하다 | Scientists cannot accurately predict future changes. |

---

## Synonyms

### diminish
→ decrease / reduce

### substantial
→ considerable / significant

### predict
→ forecast / anticipate

---

## Useful Collocations

diminish the effect
→ 효과를 약화시키다

substantial increase
→ 상당한 증가

predict future changes
→ 미래의 변화를 예측하다

